  <evidence/>
  <relationClaims>
    <relationClaim id="claim_0001">
      <subjectPersonId>person_000</subjectPersonId>
      <objectPersonId>person_001</objectPersonId>
      <sourceRelationTerm>dharma transmission</sourceRelationTerm>
      <proposedRelationType>dharma_transmission</proposedRelationType>
      <directionStatus>subject_to_object</directionStatus>
      <evidenceFragment>即賢劫第四尊示生中天竺國，剎利種，釋迦其姓也。父淨飯聖王，母摩耶聖后。周昭王九年甲寅四月八日降誕， 捨轉輪聖王位出家，成無上道，轉大法輪。其後七十九歲，垂般涅槃，乃以大法印付囑摩訶迦葉。 穆王三十六年壬申二月十五日中夜入滅。後一千一十七年，教被華夏，即漢明帝永平十年丁卯歲也。 按傳燈諸錄，首紀七佛，次列諸祖。唯東山傳法正宗記則謂正宗者，必以親相師承為効，故以釋迦文佛為始祖，</evidenceFragment>
      <extractionRule>mention_in_biography</extractionRule>
      <reviewStatus>pending</reviewStatus>
    </relationClaim>
    <relationClaim id="claim_0002">
      <subjectPersonId>person_005</subjectPersonId>
      <objectPersonId>person_006</objectPersonId>
      <sourceRelationTerm>dharma transmission</sourceRelationTerm>
      <proposedRelationType>dharma_transmission</proposedRelationType>
      <directionStatus>subject_to_object</directionStatus>
      <evidenceFragment>摩伽陀國人。父夢金 日而生，遇優波尊者， 為釋夢義，得受正法。 後付彌遮迦，化火自 焚，即周莊王世也。</evidenceFragment>
      <extractionRule>mention_in_biography</extractionRule>
      <reviewStatus>pending</reviewStatus>
    </relationClaim>
    <relationClaim id="claim_0003">
      <subjectPersonId>person_006</subjectPersonId>
      <objectPersonId>person_007</objectPersonId>
      <sourceRelationTerm>dharma transmission</sourceRelationTerm>
      <proposedRelationType>dharma_transmission</proposedRelationType>
      <directionStatus>subject_to_object</directionStatus>
      <evidenceFragment>中印度人至北天竺 國，見城堞間有金色 瑞雲，曰：此大乘氣也。 遇婆須蜜，付以法。周 襄王世，化火自焚。</evidenceFragment>
      <extractionRule>mention_in_biography</extractionRule>
      <reviewStatus>pending</reviewStatus>
    </relationClaim>
    <relationClaim id="claim_0004">
      <subjectPersonId>person_007</subjectPersonId>
      <objectPersonId>person_008</objectPersonId>
      <sourceRelationTerm>dharma transmission</sourceRelationTerm>
      <proposedRelationType>dharma_transmission</proposedRelationType>
      <directionStatus>subject_to_object</directionStatus>
      <evidenceFragment>北天竺國人，姓頗羅 墮。行化至迦摩羅國， 以論義服，佛陀難提 付以正法。周定王世， 示寂本座，塔葬全身。</evidenceFragment>
      <extractionRule>mention_in_biography</extractionRule>
      <reviewStatus>pending</reviewStatus>
    </relationClaim>
    <relationClaim id="claim_0005">
      <subjectPersonId>person_012</subjectPersonId>
      <objectPersonId>person_013</objectPersonId>
      <sourceRelationTerm>dharma transmission</sourceRelationTerm>
      <proposedRelationType>dharma_transmission</proposedRelationType>
      <directionStatus>subject_to_object</directionStatus>
      <evidenceFragment>波羅奈國人，亦名功 勝，以其功德殊勝故 也。攝伏迦毗摩羅為 弟子，遂以法付之。周 顯王世，趣大寂滅。</evidenceFragment>
      <extractionRule>mention_in_biography</extractionRule>
      <reviewStatus>pending</reviewStatus>
    </relationClaim>
    <relationClaim id="claim_0006">
      <subjectPersonId>person_014</subjectPersonId>
      <objectPersonId>person_015</objectPersonId>
      <sourceRelationTerm>dharma transmission</sourceRelationTerm>
      <proposedRelationType>dharma_transmission</proposedRelationType>
      <directionStatus>subject_to_object</directionStatus>
      <evidenceFragment>西天竺國人，廣造眾 論，開釋正法，以應機 宜。將垂滅度，乃以其 法印付迦那提婆，當 秦始皇世也。</evidenceFragment>
      <extractionRule>mention_in_biography</extractionRule>
      <reviewStatus>pending</reviewStatus>
    </relationClaim>
    <relationClaim id="claim_0007">
      <subjectPersonId>person_024</subjectPersonId>
      <objectPersonId>person_025</objectPersonId>
      <sourceRelationTerm>dharma transmission</sourceRelationTerm>
      <proposedRelationType>dharma_transmission</proposedRelationType>
      <directionStatus>subject_to_object</directionStatus>
      <evidenceFragment>中天竺國婆羅門氏， 以法授婆舍斯多，自 以宿業當酬，獨留罽 賓而遇害，即魏廢帝 齊王曹芳之世。</evidenceFragment>
      <extractionRule>mention_in_biography</extractionRule>
      <reviewStatus>pending</reviewStatus>
    </relationClaim>
    <relationClaim id="claim_0008">
      <subjectPersonId>person_027</subjectPersonId>
      <objectPersonId>person_028</objectPersonId>
      <sourceRelationTerm>dharma transmission</sourceRelationTerm>
      <proposedRelationType>dharma_transmission</proposedRelationType>
      <directionStatus>subject_to_object</directionStatus>
      <evidenceFragment>東印度人。初以童子 遇不如蜜多，顯其聖 迹，遂出家傳法。遊化 南印度，得菩提達磨 付法。宋孝武世入滅。</evidenceFragment>
      <extractionRule>mention_in_biography</extractionRule>
      <reviewStatus>pending</reviewStatus>
    </relationClaim>
    <relationClaim id="claim_0009">
      <subjectPersonId>person_030</subjectPersonId>
      <objectPersonId>person_031</objectPersonId>
      <sourceRelationTerm>dharma transmission</sourceRelationTerm>
      <proposedRelationType>dharma_transmission</proposedRelationType>
      <directionStatus>subject_to_object</directionStatus>
      <evidenceFragment>不知何許人。以處士 見慧可大師，受度傳 法，隱舒州皖公山三 十載。後得道信，付以 法眼。隋煬帝大業二 年丙寅十月十五日 立化。唐玄宗諡鑑智， 塔曰覺寂。</evidenceFragment>
      <extractionRule>mention_in_biography</extractionRule>
      <reviewStatus>pending</reviewStatus>
    </relationClaim>
